Run `verify.sh` or test with `kubectl`:
```bash
kubectl exec deployment/frontend -- curl --connect-timeout 3 http://backend-service:8080
```
Expected Output:
```
200 OK - Backend API Connected
```
The HTTP connection completes immediately returning `200 OK` with zero timeouts.
